Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on the most diverse pool3 to see if that improves over best_single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if the average of the correlated models beats weighted inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the moderately stable pool3 to see if it beats the weighted inverse_error on pool4.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

