Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a median combination over pool4 to see if a robust central tendency beats the weighted inverse_error on the same pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over pool4 to see if trimming improves over mean and weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

